data.content:
Two files created:

**`SortableList.razor`** — Markup with `@typeparam TItem`. Renders a `<ul>` with Move Up/Down buttons per item, using `@key` for efficient diffing. Buttons are disabled at list boundaries.

**`SortableList.razor.cs`** — Code-behind `partial class`:
- Copies `Items` into a private `_items` list in `OnParametersSet` (never mutates the parent's list).
- Swap + `InvokeAsync` on each move, passing back an `IReadOnlyList<TItem>`.

**Usage:**
```razor
<SortableList Items="@tasks" OnOrderChanged="HandleReorder">
    <ItemTemplate>
        <span>@context.Title</span>
    </ItemTemplate>
</SortableList>

@code {
    private List<TaskItem> tasks = new() { ... };

    private void HandleReorder(IReadOnlyList<TaskItem> updated)
    {
        tasks = updated.ToList();
    }
}
```
